{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MbZPxgT8GDFov9wZmK1Jpt","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tStudy group check-in — Thursday, 2026-09-10\n2\t\n3\tPresent: Priya, Marcus, Sara, Jonah\n4\t\n5\t- Priya walked through the intake form; the address field is still free-text\n6\t  and half the responses came in with typos. She'll switch it to an autocomplete\n7\t  by next Thursday.\n8\t- Marcus said the calendar link 404s if someone opens it after Friday. He'll\n9\t  regenerate the link every Monday morning until we fix the underlying page.\n10\t- Sara raised that new members don't know where to sit. Jonah offered to make\n11\t  a one-page seating map by Wednesday and print six copies.\n12\t- We agreed to keep the sign-up form to name only — no email, no account.\n13\t  Priya to remove the email field from the form by Thursday.\n14\t- Next check-in: Thursday 2026-09-17, same room, 6pm.\n15\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fa3e1201-2a69-4e94-9bbe-dd4c0093abe7","uuid":"f133c041-5b4a-4b1b-8237-f97813061498","timestamp":"2026-09-10T12:47:11.364Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/sc-vague-a1/notes.txt","content":"Study group check-in — Thursday, 2026-09-10\n\nPresent: Priya, Marcus, Sara, Jonah\n\n- Priya walked through the intake form; the address field is still free-text\n  and half the responses came in with typos. She'll switch it to an autocomplete\n  by next Thursday.\n- Marcus said the calendar link 404s if someone opens it after Friday. He'll\n  regenerate the link every Monday morning until we fix the underlying page.\n- Sara raised that new members don't know where to sit. Jonah offered to make\n  a one-page seating map by Wednesday and print six copies.\n- We agreed to keep the sign-up form to name only — no email, no account.\n  Priya to remove the email field from the form by Thursday.\n- Next check-in: Thursday 2026-09-17, same room, 6pm.\n","numLines":15,"startLine":1,"totalLine